---
// 正在播放舞台: 黑胶指示 + 同步歌词 + 右侧曲目侧边栏
// 监听: gallery-album-open / album-selected / playback-state / playback-progress
// 派发: album-selected / auto-play-album / song-selected / seek-to-time
---

<div class="now-playing-stage" id="now-playing-stage">
  <section
    class="listening-intro"
    id="listening-intro"
    aria-labelledby="listening-intro-title"
  >
    <h1 id="listening-intro-title">
      <span class="intro-title-lead">四种声音</span>
      <span class="intro-title-tail">一个时代</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="listening-intro-copy">
      这里收藏周杰伦、王力宏、陶喆与林俊杰的专辑，也把四位创作者放回完整唱片的语境。陶喆以松弛的律动重塑华语
      R&amp;B，周杰伦把说唱、古典与中国式旋律带进流行音乐，王力宏在抒情、摇滚和东方元素之间拓宽制作边界，林俊杰则用细密旋律与宽阔声线记录城市情绪。这里不打乱曲序，也不把专辑压缩成热门单曲；挑一张封面，从第一首听到最后一首，感受开场、中段与尾声如何共同完成一段叙事。
    </p>
    <p class="listening-intro-hint">左右滑动浏览，轻触封面，从第一首开始听</p>
  </section>

  <section class="record-context" id="record-context" aria-hidden="true">
    <h1 class="record-context-title" id="record-context-title">
      正在播放的唱片
    </h1>
    <p class="record-context-meta" id="record-context-meta"></p>
    <p class="record-context-description" id="record-context-description"></p>
  </section>

  <div class="stage-left">
    <div class="stage-vinyl" id="stage-vinyl" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="vinyl-disc">
        <div class="vinyl-label" id="vinyl-label"></div>
        <div class="vinyl-hole"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="tonearm" id="tonearm">
        <div class="tonearm-pivot"></div>
        <div class="tonearm-rod"></div>
        <div class="tonearm-head"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="vinyl-notes" id="vinyl-notes"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="lyrics-panel" id="lyrics-panel" aria-label="歌词">
      <p class="lyrics-empty" id="lyrics-empty" hidden></p>
      <div class="lyrics-scroll" id="lyrics-scroll"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <aside class="track-panel" id="track-panel" aria-label="专辑曲目">
    <button
      class="track-panel-handle"
      id="track-panel-handle"
      type="button"
      aria-label="展开或收起曲目"
      aria-expanded="false"
    >
      <span class="handle-chevron i-ri-arrow-left-s-line"></span>
    </button>
    <div class="track-panel-body" id="track-panel-body" aria-hidden="true">
      <header class="track-panel-head">
        <img
          class="panel-cover"
          id="panel-cover"
          src="/joruno.png"
          alt="专辑封面"
        />
        <div class="panel-meta">
          <h2 class="panel-title" id="panel-title">专辑</h2>
          <p class="panel-sub" id="panel-sub"></p>
          <button class="panel-play-all" id="panel-play-all" type="button">
            <span class="i-ri-play-fill"></span> 播放专辑
          </button>
        </div>
      </header>
      <ol class="panel-tracks" id="panel-tracks"></ol>
    </div>
  </aside>
</div>

<style>
  .now-playing-stage {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 4;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .listening-intro {
    position: absolute;
    top: clamp(5.5rem, 13vh, 8.25rem);
    left: clamp(1.5rem, 6vw, 6.5rem);
    z-index: 3;
    width: min(43rem, 48vw);
    color: var(--music-text-strong);
    pointer-events: none;
    transition:
      opacity 360ms ease,
      transform 520ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  }
  .listening-intro::before {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    width: 3rem;
    height: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    background: var(--music-accent-fill);
  }
  .listening-intro.is-hidden {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(-0.75rem);
  }
  .listening-intro h1 {
    display: flex;
    max-width: none;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.28em;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 3.8vw, 3.55rem);
    font-weight: 720;
    letter-spacing: -0.065em;
    line-height: 0.96;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .intro-title-lead,
  .intro-title-tail {
    display: block;
  }
  .intro-title-tail {
    color: var(--music-text-soft);
    font-weight: 520;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }
  .listening-intro-copy {
    max-width: 43rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
    color: var(--music-text-soft);
    font-size: clamp(0.86rem, 1vw, 1rem);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    line-height: 1.8;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .listening-intro-hint {
    margin: 1.1rem 0 0;
    color: var(--music-accent-text);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  }
  .record-context {
    position: absolute;
    top: clamp(6.5rem, 13vh, 8.25rem);
    left: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6.5rem);
    z-index: 3;
    width: min(34rem, 38vw);
    color: var(--music-text-strong);
    text-align: left;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    transform: translateY(0.75rem);
    transition:
      opacity 360ms ease,
      transform 520ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  }
  .record-context::before {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    width: 3rem;
    height: 1px;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    background: var(--music-accent-fill);
  }
  .record-context.has-album {
    opacity: 0.78;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
  .record-context-title {
    max-width: 10ch;
    margin: 0 0 0.65rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4.6vw, 4.9rem);
    font-weight: 720;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 0.94;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .record-context-meta {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--music-text-soft);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }
  .record-context-description {
    display: block;
    max-width: 32rem;
    max-height: var(--record-description-max-height, none);
    overflow: hidden;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--music-text-soft);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--music-border-soft);
    font-size: clamp(0.98rem, 1vw, 1.08rem);
    letter-spacing: 0.025em;
    line-height: 1.75;
    text-align: left;
    text-wrap: pretty;
    -webkit-line-clamp: unset;
  }
  :global(#music-page-wrapper.stage-description-clipped)
    .record-context-description {
    mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, #000 82%, transparent 100%);
  }
  :global(#music-page-wrapper.stage-hide-description)
    .record-context-description {
    display: none;
  }
  .record-context-description:empty {
    display: none;
  }
  :global(#music-page-wrapper.stage-compact-intro) .listening-intro,
  :global(#music-page-wrapper.stage-compact-intro) .record-context {
    width: clamp(10.5rem, var(--stage-intro-fit, 22rem), 28rem);
  }
  :global(#music-page-wrapper.stage-compact-intro) .record-context-title,
  :global(#music-page-wrapper.stage-compact-intro) .record-context-title {
    max-width: 9ch;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.6vw, 3.6rem);
    line-height: 0.96;
  }
  :global(#music-page-wrapper.stage-compact-intro) .listening-intro h1 {
    max-width: none;
    gap: 0.2em;
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2.8vw, 2rem);
  }
  :global(#music-page-wrapper.stage-compact-intro) .record-context-description {
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
    padding-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: clamp(0.94rem, 0.96vw, 1.02rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    -webkit-line-clamp: unset;
  }
  :global(#music-page-wrapper.stage-compact-intro) .listening-intro-copy {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(0.72rem, 0.82vw, 0.86rem);
    line-height: 1.62;
    -webkit-line-clamp: unset;
  }
  :global(#music-page-wrapper.stage-compact-intro) .listening-intro-hint {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }
  .stage-left {
    position: absolute;
    top: clamp(6.25rem, 12vh, 7.75rem);
    right: clamp(2.75rem, 5vw, 5.5rem);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row-reverse;
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(1.4rem, 2.5vw, 2.8rem);
    max-width: calc(100vw - clamp(2rem, 8vw, 8rem));
    pointer-events: auto;
    transform-origin: right center;
    transition:
      transform 520ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
      opacity 220ms ease;
  }
  .stage-vinyl {
    flex: none;
    width: min(
      clamp(9rem, min(19vw, 32vh), 19rem),
      var(--stage-player-max-size, 100vmax)
    );
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 1.4rem 2.6rem rgb(0 0 0 / 55%));
  }
  .vinyl-disc {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background:
      repeating-radial-gradient(
        circle,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045) 0 1px,
        transparent 1px 4px
      ),
      radial-gradient(circle, #202124 0 26%, #0d0e10 27% 100%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: vinyl-spin var(--spin-duration, 3.6s) linear infinite;
    animation-play-state: paused;
  }
  .stage-vinyl.is-playing .vinyl-disc {
    animation-play-state: running;
  }
  /* 唱臂: 支点在右上角,播放落针/暂停抬针,点击切换播放 */
  .tonearm {
    position: absolute;
    top: -4%;
    right: -7%;
    width: 46%;
    height: 60%;
    transform-origin: 78% 12%;
    transform: rotate(-24deg);
    transition:
      transform 700ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),
      filter 180ms ease;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0.5rem 0.9rem rgb(0 0 0 / 45%));
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .tonearm:hover {
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0.5rem 0.9rem rgb(0 0 0 / 45%)) brightness(1.35);
  }
  .stage-vinyl.is-playing .tonearm {
    transform: rotate(6deg);
  }
  .tonearm-pivot {
    position: absolute;
    top: 4%;
    right: 12%;
    width: 22%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 38% 34%, #4a4d52, #1b1d20 68%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgb(255 255 255 / 18%);
  }
  .tonearm-rod {
    position: absolute;
    top: 12%;
    right: 20%;
    width: 3.5%;
    height: 74%;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #52555a, #2c2e32);
    border-radius: 999px;
    transform: rotate(14deg);
    transform-origin: top center;
  }
  .tonearm-head {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 2%;
    left: 47%;
    width: 12%;
    height: 15%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #5d6167, #24262a);
    border-radius: 0.15rem;
    transform: rotate(24deg);
  }
  .vinyl-label {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    width: 50%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    background: var(--album-color, #333) center/cover no-repeat;
    background-image: var(--vinyl-cover, none);
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px rgb(0 0 0 / 35%);
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  }
  .vinyl-hole {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    width: 4.5%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    background: #060607;
    border-radius: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  }
  @keyframes vinyl-spin {
    to {
      transform: rotate(360deg);
    }
  }

  /* 播放时飘出的音符 */
  .vinyl-notes {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -30%;
    overflow: visible;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .vinyl-notes :global(.note) {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 46%;
    left: 50%;
    color: var(--music-accent-text, #f6d23c);
    opacity: 0;
    animation: note-float var(--note-dur, 2.6s) ease-out forwards;
    will-change: transform, opacity;
  }
  @keyframes note-float {
    0% {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translate(-50%, 0) rotate(0deg) scale(0.6);
    }
    12% {
      opacity: var(--note-alpha, 0.85);
    }
    100% {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translate(calc(-50% + var(--note-dx, 2rem)), -7.5rem)
        rotate(var(--note-rot, 18deg)) scale(var(--note-scale, 1));
    }
  }

  .lyrics-panel {
    --lyrics-preferred-height: clamp(10rem, 32vh, 20rem);
    --lyrics-height: min(
      var(--lyrics-preferred-height),
      var(--stage-player-max-size, 100vmax)
    );
    --lyrics-line-box: 2.05rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    flex: 1 1 clamp(12rem, 21vw, 22rem);
    width: clamp(12rem, 21vw, 22rem);
    min-width: 0;
    height: var(--lyrics-height);
    max-height: var(--lyrics-height);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .lyrics-empty {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--music-text-muted, rgba(247, 242, 234, 0.35));
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 520;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-shadow:
      0 1px 1px rgb(0 0 0 / 85%),
      0 0 1.2rem rgb(0 0 0 / 72%);
  }
  .lyrics-scroll {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    height: 100%;
    max-height: none;
    overflow-x: hidden;
    overflow-y: auto;
    /* Keep the opening and ending lines inside the fade mask without adding
       enough empty space for either edge line to move into the centre. */
    padding-block-start: calc(var(--lyrics-line-box) * 0.75);
    padding-block-end: calc(var(--lyrics-line-box) * 0.75);
    scrollbar-width: none;
    mask-image: linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      transparent,
      #000 16%,
      #000 84%,
      transparent
    );
  }
  .lyrics-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }
  .lyrics-scroll :global(.lyric-line) {
    display: block;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 100%;
    padding: 0.38rem 0;
    background: none;
    border: 0;
    color: var(--music-text-muted, rgba(247, 242, 234, 0.38));
    font-size: clamp(0.94rem, 1.08vw, 1.1rem);
    letter-spacing: 0.025em;
    line-height: 1.62;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    text-align: left;
    text-shadow:
      0 1px 1px rgb(0 0 0 / 86%),
      0 0 1.2rem rgb(0 0 0 / 76%);
    cursor: pointer;
    white-space: normal;
    word-break: break-word;
    transition:
      color 180ms ease,
      font-size 220ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
      transform 180ms ease;
  }
  .lyrics-scroll :global(.lyric-line-shell) {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .lyrics-scroll :global(.lyric-seek-time),
  .lyrics-scroll :global(.lyric-seek-confirm) {
    display: none;
  }
  .lyrics-scroll :global(.lyric-line:hover) {
    color: var(--music-text-soft, rgba(247, 242, 234, 0.68));
  }
  .lyrics-scroll :global(.lyric-line:focus) {
    outline: none;
    box-shadow: none;
  }
  .lyrics-scroll :global(.lyric-line:focus-visible) {
    color: var(--music-text-strong, #fffaf2);
    outline: none;
  }
  .lyrics-scroll :global(.lyric-line.is-current) {
    color: var(--music-accent-text, #f6d23c);
    font-size: inherit;
    font-weight: 720;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
    transform: none;
  }

  .lyrics-scroll :global(.lyric-countdown) {
    display: none;
    min-height: var(--lyrics-line-box);
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.48rem;
    padding-inline: 0.15rem;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    transform: translateY(0.5rem) scale(0.96);
    transform-origin: left center;
    transition:
      opacity 360ms ease,
      transform 520ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }
  .lyrics-scroll :global(.lyric-countdown.is-visible) {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
  }
  .lyrics-scroll :global(.countdown-dot) {
    width: 0.48rem;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    background: var(--music-lyric-active, var(--music-accent-text));
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0.9rem
      color-mix(
        in srgb,
        var(--music-lyric-active, var(--music-accent-text)) 42%,
        transparent
      );
    opacity: 0.16;
    transform: scale(0.7);
    transition:
      opacity 320ms ease,
      transform 420ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }
  .lyrics-scroll :global(.countdown-dot.is-active) {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: scale(1);
    animation: countdown-breathe 820ms ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }
  @keyframes countdown-breathe {
    from {
      opacity: 0.52;
      transform: scale(0.82);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: scale(1.12);
    }
  }

  /* 右侧曲目侧边栏: 平时收在屏幕右缘只露把手,展开时滑入 */
  .track-panel {
    position: absolute;
    top: clamp(4.2rem, 9vh, 5.5rem);
    right: 0;
    bottom: clamp(4.6rem, 11vh, 6.5rem);
    z-index: 20;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    pointer-events: none;
    visibility: hidden;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateX(var(--panel-width, 24rem));
    transition:
      transform 320ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
      opacity 180ms ease,
      visibility 180ms ease;
  }
  .track-panel.is-available {
    visibility: visible;
    opacity: 1;
  }
  .track-panel.is-open {
    transform: translateX(0);
  }
  .track-panel-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    width: var(--panel-width, 24rem);
    max-height: 100%;
    padding: 1.2rem 1.4rem 1.2rem 1.6rem;
    background: color-mix(
      in srgb,
      var(--album-color, #101216) 18%,
      var(--music-panel-strong, rgb(7 8 10 / 97%))
    );
    border-inline-start: 0;
    border-radius: 0.7rem 0 0 0.7rem;
    box-shadow: -1.2rem 0 2.4rem rgb(0 0 0 / 12%);
    pointer-events: auto;
  }
  .track-panel-handle {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 1px;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 1.75rem;
    min-height: 2.1rem;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.1rem;
    background: color-mix(
      in srgb,
      var(--album-color, #101216) 18%,
      var(--music-panel-strong, rgb(7 8 10 / 97%))
    );
    border: 1px solid var(--music-border, rgb(255 255 255 / 12%));
    border-right: 0;
    border-radius: 0.45rem 0 0 0.45rem;
    color: var(--music-text-muted, rgba(247, 242, 234, 0.55));
    cursor: pointer;
    pointer-events: auto;
    transform: translate(-100%, -50%);
    transition: color 160ms ease;
  }
  .track-panel-handle:hover {
    color: var(--music-text-strong, #f7f2ea);
  }
  .track-panel-handle::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: -0.35rem 0 -0.35rem -0.35rem;
  }
  .handle-chevron {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    transition: transform 320ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  }
  .track-panel.is-open .handle-chevron {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }
  .track-panel-head {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }
  .panel-cover {
    width: 5.4rem;
    height: 5.4rem;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 0.4rem;
    box-shadow: 0 0.8rem 1.8rem rgb(0 0 0 / 45%);
  }
  .panel-meta {
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .panel-title {
    overflow: hidden;
    margin: 0 1.6rem 0.2rem 0;
    color: var(--music-text, #f7f2ea);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }
  .panel-sub {
    margin: 0 0 0.55rem;
    color: var(--music-text-muted, rgba(247, 242, 234, 0.55));
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }
  .panel-play-all {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    padding: 0.34rem 0.85rem;
    background: var(--music-accent-fill, #f6d23c);
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: var(--music-accent-contrast, #191507);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .panel-play-all:disabled {
    background: var(--music-control-soft, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14));
    color: var(--music-text-muted, rgba(247, 242, 234, 0.4));
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }
  .panel-tracks {
    flex: none;
    max-height: 52vh;
    overflow-y: auto;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    scrollbar-width: none;
  }
  .panel-tracks::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }
  .panel-tracks :global(.track-row) {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
